Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fn方正黑体简体\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}加利福利亚 洛杉矶 1998年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩们 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Boys, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 跟紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Come on, tighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.02,0:01:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,排成一行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Single file, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走在走廊中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Center of the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,单元一有状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Condition unit one!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,单元一有状况 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Condition unit one, copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐地上 举起双手 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}On the ground. Show me hands, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.10,0:01:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色代号 有人打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Code blue! Fight in progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛 让我们打啊 放开他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Come on, let's fight, man! Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码让我穿回我的鞋啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}At least let me get my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽 安妮 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-Mary Anne. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯今天打架了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Adonis got into a fight today…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.62,0:02:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他被禁闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}and he's in holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想见他我们就要上去那里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}If you wanna see him, we're gonna have to go up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好孩子 他只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}He's a good kid, he just…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.17,0:02:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常性\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰逊 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-Johnson? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-Right this way. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰逊 有访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Johnson, got a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Adonis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.21,0:03:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你见见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'd like you to meet Mrs…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以单独聊一下吗 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Could we have a moment, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在外面等\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'll be right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Why were you fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再去另一个儿童之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm not going to another group home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是儿童之家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm not from a group home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是社工 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-You a social worker? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是社工\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I am not a social worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那死黑鬼说了些我妈妈的事所以我揍他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Nigga said something about my ma so I beat his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:04:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你母亲的事很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm sorry about your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道失去至亲是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I know what it's like to lose someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你父亲死的时候我很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}When your father died, I was angry for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我伤害自己 不管家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I hurt myself, pushed family away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I don't have no father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 我说我没有父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-What did you say? - I said I don't have no father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.39,0:04:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在你出生前离世了 但你是有父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}He passed before you were born, but you had a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You knew him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾经是我的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}He was my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.94,0:04:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯 我很乐意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Adonis, I would like it very much…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来跟我一起生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}if you would come and stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Do you think you'd wanna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}What was his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fn方正黑体简体\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}奎迪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fn方正黑体简体\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}墨西哥 蒂华纳 2015年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:08:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆士 - 多 坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-Hey, James. - Don, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}What you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要升职了而你要辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You get a promotion and you're quitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 只是这职位不适合我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Look, this career just ain't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 谢谢一直以来的照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Hey, man, thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想跟你谈谈我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Just wanna talk to you about my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.69,0:08:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到你的新办公室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You see your new office?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Yeah. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那看起来怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Well, what's it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这升职可是很难得的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}This is a big deal, this promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给你请了助理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Did they hire your assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 真为你自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-Thank you. - Very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.07,0:10:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他 打他的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Take it to him. Take it to the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.77,0:10:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意时间 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Make your time count, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么应对 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You know what's coming up. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来这里干什么 - 打了15场全胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-What you doing here, man? - 15 and 0, 15 knockouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在蒂华纳 不 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}In Tijuana? No, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是酒吧打架而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}That's barroom brawling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么样我都要打\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Well, I'm all in anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我觉得我们在外地开始只是取得我们的势头…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}So I figure we start out local, just to get our momentum going…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就可以去我们想去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}then we can move wherever we wanna move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「我们」 - 我是觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-"We"? - I was figuring…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯 这些人来这里是为了生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Adonis, these boys come in here, this how they survive.
