Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一场第三战\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}behind closed doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}That true?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪里听说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}How'd you hear about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Who won?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.28,0:17:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算是个秘密 你之前说你叫什么名\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Its kind of a secret. What'd you say your name was?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Donnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩说你想谈些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}The girl said you wanted to talk about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我想跟你谈谈训练我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Yeah, I want to talk to you about training me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Training you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再训练人了 很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I don't do that stuff no more. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 现在很晚了 所以我要关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Listen, it's getting kind of late, kid. So I'm gonna dose up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有多厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}How good was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 阿波罗 他很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Who? Apollo? Yeah, he was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个完美的拳击手 没有人更甚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}He's a perfect fighter. Ain't nobody ever better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.17,0:17:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你是怎么打倒他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}So how'd you beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时间打倒了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Time beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间带走所有人 是无敌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Time takes everybody out, it's undefeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么样 我要关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Anyway, I gotta lock up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当米奇死的时候他来跟你谈过 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}When Mickey died, he came and talked to you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你别放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Talked you out of quitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你去洛杉矶 训练你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Took you to L.A., trained you…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你重新振作\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}brought you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道这些事的 - 你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-How do you know all this? - How do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是什么人 亲戚吗 - 他是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-What are you, like a cousin? - He's my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 才不是 我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}No, he isn't. I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给玛丽 安妮啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Call Mary Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 安妮 他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Mary Anne. His wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭电话没有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}The house number still works.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哦 你自从葬礼后就没跟她谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Oh, that's right. You haven't talked to her since the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然她说你说了一段很好的演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}She said you gave a nice speech, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好的演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Nice speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.47,0:18:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你训练我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I want you to train me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一个可靠的人而还有哪个更好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I need somebody solid and who else better to go to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你欠我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You at least owe me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你说话你是个文化人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I can tell the way you talk, you been to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我以为你挺聪明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}So I figure you got some brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要选择一个拳击手的人生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Why would you want to pick a fighter's life…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而当你没这个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}when you don't have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果阿波罗还活着他也会这么跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}If Apollo was around, he would tell you that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:18:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Well he ain't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.97,0:19:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生都在打拼 我没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I been fighting my whole life. I ain't got a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这总是关于一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}It's always about a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.91,0:19:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前在擂台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I was in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到是什么下场 那场比赛应该停止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I saw how it went down. That fight should've been stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.64,0:19:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I should have stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.11,0:19:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他想像一个拳击手的死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Maybe he wanted to go out like a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你做的完全是他所想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Maybe, you did exactly what he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他了宁愿在这里跟你聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I think he'd rather be here, talking with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.27,0:19:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们很相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}There is a resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一般都在这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm usually here all the time…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.55,0:19:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你在附近想过来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}so if you're ever in the neighborhood, come by…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.51,0:19:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}if you need something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天会在米奇的拳击馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'll be at Mickey's Gym tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.68,0:19:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不去那里的 我没去那里很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I don't go there.I haven't been there in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们像家人一样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Since we're pretty much like family…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三场比赛谁赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}who won the third fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.49,0:20:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在拳击里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}In boxing…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拳击手的起点是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}fighters' origins can endure as the most…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们形象最神圣的要素…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}sacred element of their identity…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个选择可以永远改变他们的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}shaping choices that can change their lives forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「漂亮」 瑞奇康兰是英格兰利物浦出身\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}"Pretty" Ricky Conlan is a faithful son of Liverpool, England…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.11,0:20:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个人们在传说中的英雄…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}a place where people find hope…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.55,0:20:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找希望的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}in the tales of their heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对于世界上不败最强的同等级重量拳击手来讲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}But for the undefeated best pound-for-pound boxer in the world…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来是充满不确定性的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}the future is filled with uncertainty…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着一个监禁七年的判决逼近\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}with a seven-year prison sentence looming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不打算在监房里浪费我的全盛时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I didn't plan on spending me prime years in a prison cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌让我的家人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I hate letting me family down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.86,0:21:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在在家等着他的最后比赛会是什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Now what could be his final bout awaits him at home…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他城市里其中一座最神圣的体育馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}in one of his city's most hallowed sporting temples.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.37,0:21:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 他会迎接一位同样从没被击败过的对手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Here, he'll welcome an opponent who's also never been beaten…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个以他的方式从加利福利亚街头…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}and who's boxed his way from California streets…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,打到成为美国巨星\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}to American stardom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从著名的特尔斐拳击学院出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Fighting out of the famed Delphi Boxing Academy…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个被过去偶像的父亲指导的教练…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}with a trainer whose father guided icons of the past…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼「特技演员」 惠勒相信他是这项运动的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Danny "Stuntman" Wheeler believes he's the sport's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,康兰要离开很久 现在轮到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Conlan's going away for a long time. Now it's my turn.
