Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.60,2:00:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪被连续重拳攻击…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Creed getting hit with some hard shots…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.33,2:00:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他自己站稳了 而且阿多尼斯反击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}but landing some of his own, and Adonis is firing back!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.27,2:00:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个战士间的另一种较量\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Another pitched battle between the two warriors.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.21,2:00:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇 结束他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Ricky, nail him!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.14,2:00:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Come on, kid!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.24,2:00:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪转身 把冠军逼到了角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Creed spins, puts the champ in the corner!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.71,2:00:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,打身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Body!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.32,2:00:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就像洛奇 巴尔博亚挥动身体攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Throwing body shots like he's Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.25,2:01:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就像阿波罗 奎迪一样攻击上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Going upstairs like he's Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.65,2:01:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,揍死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Knock his ass out!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.69,2:01:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛快结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Closing seconds of the fight!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.32,2:01:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Ricky!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.49,2:01:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.19,2:01:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,康兰倒下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Conlan is down!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.63,2:01:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他职业生涯首次倒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}That is the first time in his career he's been on the canvas.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.17,2:01:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能在最后一回合靠铃声所救\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You cannot be saved by the bell in the 12th and final round.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.67,2:01:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Ricky, get up!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.54,2:01:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.64,2:01:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.51,2:01:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,六\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Six!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.08,2:01:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在利物浦激动人心的倒数 - 七 八\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-Dramatic count in Liverpool. - Seven! Eight!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.61,2:01:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须要起来才能有机会赢这场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}He must get up to preserve his chance to win the fight.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.11,2:01:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-Are you all right? - I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.28,2:01:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着我 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-Look at me! - I'm all right!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.18,2:01:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他起来了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-He's up! - What?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.85,2:01:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,铃声响起 所以康兰在最终回合活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}The bell sounds, so Conlan survives the 12th round!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.22,2:01:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}What a finish!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.99,2:01:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那回合再多三十秒我们可能就有新冠军了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}If that round goes another 30 seconds, we may have a new champion.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.46,2:01:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个难忘的晚上的一场难忘的拳赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}An unforgettable fight on an unforgettable night!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.76,2:01:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不再只是一个跟阿波罗 奎迪的同姓人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}He's no longer just the namesake of Apollo Creed, …
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.06,2:01:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个活着的化身\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}he's the living embodiment.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.53,2:01:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们和先生们 来点掌声…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Ladies and gentlemen, a round of applause…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.20,2:01:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,给擂台上的这两位战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}for these two warriors in the ring!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.70,2:01:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,由得分决定的胜者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}To the winner by split decision…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.11,2:01:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然是不败的世界冠军…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}and still the undefeated champion of the world…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.21,2:02:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You did great, kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.81,2:02:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「漂亮」 瑞奇 康兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}"Pretty" Ricky Conlan!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.38,2:02:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐尼 你是输在时间上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Donnie, you were robbed.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.85,2:02:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果还多十秒钟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}If this fight had been 10 seconds longer…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.52,2:02:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,多十秒钟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}10 seconds longer…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.95,2:02:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Creed.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.79,2:02:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续努力 朋友 你是拳坛的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You go and get it, chum. You the future of this division.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.93,2:02:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带着骄傲配得上这名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You wear that name with pride.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.56,2:02:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Respect.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.53,2:02:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 阿多尼斯 不懈的努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Congratulations, Adonis, on a sensational effort.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.14,2:02:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想感谢我的母亲 她在家里 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I just wanna thank my mom. She's at home. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.74,2:02:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我知道她对我打拳很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Even though I know she's mad at me for doing this.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.44,2:02:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我会让你觉得骄傲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Hopefully I made her proud.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.18,2:02:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点让我心脏病发作了 但我很为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You almost gave me a heart attack but I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.68,2:02:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有我的家人在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I got my family right.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.08,2:02:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他们就没有我在这的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Without them none of this would've been possible.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.42,2:02:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Rocky…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.08,2:02:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗 奎迪的儿子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Apollo Creed's son…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.79,2:02:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你说家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}looks at you and says family.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.35,2:02:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你有什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}What does that mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.69,2:02:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着我很幸运 我还能说什么 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}It means I'm a lucky guy. What can I say, right, kid?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.50,2:02:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个真正的斗士 而且他在帮我面对新的挑战…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}He's a real fighter, and he's helping me fight a new things…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.23,2:02:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我很感激 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}so I appreciate it. I really do.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.63,2:02:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯 我知道你从没见过你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Adonis, I know you never met your father.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.53,2:02:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果他今晚在这里 你会想对他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}But if he was here tonight, what would you wanna say to him?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.21,2:03:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想告诉他我爱他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'll just tell him I love him…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.38,2:03:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我知道他不是故意丢下我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}and I know he didn't leave me on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.51,2:03:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我很骄傲能成为一个奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}And I'm proud to be a Creed.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.49,2:03:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 还有为你极好的表现表示祝贺 吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Thanks, Adonis, and congratulations on a sensational performance. Jim.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.96,2:03:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Creed! Creed! Creed!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.80,2:03:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.93,2:03:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们说说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Talk to them. Go on!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.99,2:03:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众们都热情高涨 没有一个想离开竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}This crowd is up on its feet. No one wants to leave the arena.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.49,2:03:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个在这里的人都知道他们看到些很特别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Everyone in here knows they've seen something special.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.00,2:03:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场他们永不会忘的拳赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}A fight they will never forget.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.80,2:04:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇 康兰赢了比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Ricky Conlan wins the fight.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.07,2:04:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多尼斯 奎恩赢了这个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Adonis Creed wins the night.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.79,2:04:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}This is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.96,2:04:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.17,2:04:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想看看我能不能爬这些楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I just wanna see if I can get up these steps.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.57,2:04:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一次过来是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}When's the first time you came here?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.40,2:04:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时12岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I was 12.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.21,2:04:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是我最喜欢的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I think it's my favorite place.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.55,2:04:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你登到顶端…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}When you get to the top…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.65,2:04:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会觉得你可以飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}you think you can fly.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.07,2:05:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.37,2:05:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You got this.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.52,2:05:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Come on, young man.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.58,2:05:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我喘口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Just let me catch my breath.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.85,2:05:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 别休息 我们到顶端休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Come on, no breaks. We rest at the top.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.99,2:05:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.92,2:05:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是你要求的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Nah, this is what you asked for, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.99,2:05:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 一步一步来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Lets go. One step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.06,2:05:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.83,2:05:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.00,2:05:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一步一步来 谁告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}One step at a time. Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.90,2:05:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个老家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Some old guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.67,2:05:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是说你 不是说我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You know I meant that for you, not for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.78,2:05:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们又增加了几级楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I think they added a few more steps.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.05,2:05:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.68,2:05:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.72,2:05:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来走完这最后两级\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm gonna take these last two.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.35,2:05:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一级\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}One more step.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.15,2:06:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.79,2:06:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Good. Really good.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.66,2:06:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 老家伙 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-You all right there, old man? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.20,2:06:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,风景真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Nice view.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.81,2:06:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你注意看你可以在这到你整个人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}If you look hard enough, you can see your whole life from up here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.88,2:06:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}How does it look?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.68,2:06:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Not bad at all. And you?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.08,2:06:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs14}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Not bad at all.
